<title>UK: Canton Lucern sets 100 mln Sfr bond.</title>
<headline>Canton Lucern sets 100 mln Sfr bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager UBS.</p>
<p> BORROWER   CANTON LUCERN</p>
<p> AMT    100 MLN SFR   COUPON     3.5	 MATURITY    12.JUN.07</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.75    PAY DATE    12.JUN.97</p>
<p> PAY FREQ   ANNUAL    LISTING    EBS	 EOS	   06.JUN.97</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  =	   DENOMS (K) 5	   SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> NOTES	THERE IS A REOPENING CLAUSE</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
